sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant UI as Angular UI
  participant Gate as MessageV3 Gate Port
  participant Native as Tauri Native
  participant FFI as Flutter FFI
  participant Web as Browser Web
  participant E as ExecutionShell Tick
  participant IM as helix-im
  participant PS as Pending or local state
  participant Host as driver-host
  participant DB as tenant SQLite
  participant Go as Go IM Server
  participant WS as WS inbound
  participant Sink as EventSink raw bytes
  Note over UI,Gate: 用户目标：成员点发送后消息立刻出现（灰色发送中），随后转为已发送，全程不闪烁不跳位
  Note over UI,Web: 合同登记快照（不等于当前实现或实测）：mock=implemented；helix=full；dual=yes；personaLocal=no；该图是交互合同，不把 Mock、HTTP 2xx 或静态注册写成真实 Green
  alt PC Tauri 入口
    UI->>Gate: sendMessage(payload)
    Gate->>Native: invokeAccepted("im_send_message", payload)
    Native->>E: Tick::Command(AppCommand)
  else Flutter FFI 入口
    FFI->>E: helix_command("im_send_message", payload)
  else Browser Web 入口
    Web->>E: invoke("im_send_message", payload)
  end
  E->>IM: ExecutionShell::step(Tick::Command)
  IM->>IM: 校验 sending → success 三态回显 的入参，生成 corr_key/req_id
  IM->>Host: Persist optimistic message；本地媒体另含 pending_media journal 的 PersistAtomic
  Host->>DB: 提交 Sending 事实
  DB-->>Host: PersistOk
  Host->>E: Tick::PortReply(PersistOk)
  E->>IM: 匹配 optimistic corr
  opt 已 attach timeline 的普通发送
    IM->>Host: 调度 timeline 持久事实读回
    Host->>DB: 读取当前窗口
    DB-->>Host: readback
    Host->>E: Tick::PortReply(readback)
    E->>IM: 发布窗口后才释放 posts/create
  end
  Note over IM,Host: P1 失败不得发 HTTP 或启动发送 timer；im:post:sending 与 timeline 事件交付发送中状态
  IM->>Host: Effect::Http POST /posts/create + WS post 推送
  Host->>Go: HTTP request with tenant/auth/corr headers
  Go-->>Host: HTTP response（2xx 只代表 admission/query response）
  Host->>E: Tick::PortReply(http)
  E->>IM: correlate req_id/corr_key
  Go-->>WS: post authority echo（与 HTTP 回包无固定先后）
  WS->>E: Tick::Inbound(authority bytes)
  E->>IM: apply authoritative event before settlement
  IM->>Host: Effect::PersistAtomic(projection + cursor)
  Host->>DB: transaction message + channel + viewer member + cursor
  DB-->>Host: PortReply(PersistOk)
  Host->>E: Tick::PortReply(PersistOk)
  E->>IM: release only matching authority corr
  IM->>Host: Effect::Persist ScopedGet(readback)
  Host->>DB: durable readback
  DB-->>Host: PortReply(readback)
  Host->>E: Tick::PortReply(readback)
  E->>IM: readback is the projection source
  IM->>Sink: Effect::Emit {event,data}（发送者 im:post:sent；接收者 im:post:received；按分支发布频道与 timeline 投影）
  Sink-->>UI: Native im:__bus__ 原始事件 → adapter 映射 kind → Angular 消费
  Sink-->>FFI: FFI batch raw {event,data}
  Sink-->>Web: Web EventBatch raw {event,data}
  Note over IM,Sink: HTTP、超时、WS 与 Persist 失败各走对应内核分支；失败态也受持久化屏障约束，不能画成已 accepted 命令的同步返回
  Note over IM,DB: 关键效果：发送成功后发送者侧 channel.unreadCount 绝对归零（== 0，不是递减）；频道内其它可见成员的 getMemberUnread(channelId, otherUserId).unreadCount 相比发送前恰好 +1（幂等累加）；该值必须各侧独立计算，禁止用发送者数值推导；message.readBits 长度 == channel.members.length，位序 == channel.members 顺序，发送者对应位 == '1'；接收者对应位在其调用 postRead 之前恒为 '0'，不得因发送者已读而被置 '1'
  Note over UI,Web: 关键负向：权威成功由 Helix 按 temporaryId 对账；客户端绑定投影，不重建发送状态机；乐观时间使用本地时间与已观测服务端下界，回声到达后采用服务端权威 createAt；sending 不得晚于 success 到达（sequence 不变量：sending.sequence 小于 success.sequence）
  Note over E,Sink: 发送生命周期原始事件：im:post:sending / im:post:sent / im:post:received / im:post:send-failed；频道与 timeline 投影由各自读回分支发布
